<title>ITALY: Italian GDP fell 0.5 pct in Q1 97.</title>
<headline>Italian GDP fell 0.5 pct in Q1 97.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's gross domestic product (GDP) fell by 0.5 percent, year-on-year, in the first quarter of 1997, provisional figures released by National Statistics Institute Istat said.</p>
<p>GDP was down 0.3 percent from the final quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>Istat said there were two working days less in the first</p>
<p>quarter of 1997 compared to the fourth quarter of 1996 and three</p>
<p>working days less than the first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p> ITALIAN GDP			   Q1 1997    Q4 1996  Q1 1996</p>
<p> Yr/yr growth (pct)		    -0.5	 +0.1     +1.3</p>
<p> Growth versus previous quarter    -0.3	 -0.2     +0.2</p>
